Feature: Login to Knowledge Navigator

  As a user  
  I want to log in to Knowledge Navigator  
  So that I can access the application homepage  

  @smoke-test
  Scenario: Successful login with Keycloak  
    Given the user opens the KN login page  
    When the user clicks the button "Mit Keycloak anmelden"  
    And the user clicks the button "Fortfahren"  
    And the user enters a valid username  
    And the user enters a valid password  
    And the user confirms the stay signed in prompt  
    Then the user should see the Knowledge Navigator homepage  

  @smoke-test
  Scenario: Login fails with incorrect username  
    Given the user opens the KN login page  
    When the user clicks the button "Mit Keycloak anmelden"  
    And the user clicks the button "Fortfahren"  
    And the user enters an invalid username  
    And the user enters a valid password  
    Then the user should see an error message about invalid credentials  

  @smoke-test
  Scenario: Login fails with incorrect password  
    Given the user opens the KN login page  
    When the user clicks the button "Mit Keycloak anmelden"  
    And the user clicks the button "Fortfahren"  
    And the user enters a valid username  
    And the user enters an invalid password  
    Then the user should see an error message about invalid credentials
